{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story of secrets, lies, and murder.</strong><br>In <i>Kayotica</i>, you play as April\u2014a clever but manipulative student caught in a web of friendship, rivalry, and dark crimes. What begins as ordinary campus life quickly turns into a mystery of betrayal, hidden truths, and a shocking murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve the mystery, or will you become the next victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kayotica</i> is a choice-driven <strong>visual novel</strong> full of suspense and drama. Each decision you make changes April\u2019s relationships, her fate, and the truth you uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murder Mystery</strong> \u2013 Uncover the truth behind a deadly crime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Choices &amp; Endings</strong> \u2013 Your decisions matter and lead to different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Art</strong> \u2013 Characters and backgrounds with rich detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI challenge\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Where you talk with an AI character to dynamically complete the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Relationships</strong> \u2013 Build or break bonds with your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Explore new paths and hidden truths on every playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A visual novel where love, lies, and murder meet. Welcome to Kayotica.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884310?t=1771433746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884310?t=1771433746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s